                "file_path": "src/utils/letter-box.ts",
                "comment": "stripInternalMarkup() strips DeepSeek DSML tags from the letter-box reply"
              },
              {
                "target_type": "term",
                "term_name": "Loop Notation (LN)",
                "comment": "Compact notation for message role rotation in the agent loop: system/user/agent (text), [tool1, tool2]? (batched LLM tool calls), tool1! (result, one at a time), _tool1_ (compacted placeholder)"
              },
              {
                "target_type": "term",
                "term_name": "DSML stripping",
                "comment": "DeepSeek-specific: letter-box strips internal DSML markup tags like <ds_safety>/<ds_thinking> via stripInternalMarkup() in letter-box.ts"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "/mycc.md/reference-documents",
            "text": "- `docs/agent-context.md` - AgentContext module (Chinese)\n- `docs/agent-loop.md` - Agent loop (Chinese)\n- `docs/agent-tools.md` - Built-in tools reference\n- `docs/child-context.md` - Child process and IPC (Chinese)\n- `docs/dynamic-loading.md` - Tool/skill loading mechanism\n- `docs/pinned-todo-reactivation.md` - Pinned todos and reactivation feature design\n- `docs/database-schema.md` - Data storage schema (Chinese, historical reference — SQLite removed in v0.7.0)",
            "title": "Reference Documents",
            "summary": "The \"Reference Documents\" section catalogs seven design/reference docs. **`docs/agent-context.md`** (Chinese) documents AgentContext: ParentContext (lead, direct module access) vs ChildContext (teammate, IPC forwarding), with 9 modules — core, todo, mail, skill (Loader), issue, bg, team, wiki (LanceDB vector KB), and peer (cross-instance discovery) — plus core features (question, imgDescribe, grants, confusion index, mode/auto control). No `wt` module exists; worktrees are queried via `worktree-store.ts`. **`docs/agent-loop.md`** describes the STAR-principle loop as an explicit state machine (PROMPT→SLASH/COLLECT→LLM→HOOK→TOOL→STOP, plus AWAIT for auto mode) with autoCompact (50K token threshold in LLM state via forkChat), COLLECT pre-collection pipeline (mails, hint rounds, todo nudging every 3 passes, brief nudging every 5), and team awaiting in STOP. **`docs/agent-tools.md`** is the built-in tools reference — 48 tools (v0.10.1) with main/child scope constraints. **`docs/child-context.md`** (Chinese) covers child IPC: IpcRegistry/IpcClient, WORK/IDLE/HOLDING/SHUTDOWN state machine, auto-claim of published issues (5s polling), message-type tables. **`docs/dynamic-loading.md`** documents the Loader class, three skill sources (user < project < built-in priority), hot-reload only for project `.mycc/` dirs, and skill discovery via skill_search/skill_load. **`docs/pinned-todo-reactivation.md`** is a design doc for persistent pinned todos (main-only `todo_pinning`) and condition-based reactivation via forkChat on the nudge cadence. **`docs/archived/database-schema.md`** (Chinese, archived) is historical — SQLite removed in v0.7.0, replaced by in-memory `memory-store.ts` and JSON `worktree-store.ts`; retains old SQLite table definitions.",
            "level": 2,
            "children": [],
            "links": []
          }
        ],
